The LG webOS SSAP registration and power-state handling in server/internal/webos/
follows the protocol as documented by the open-source projects
aiowebostv (https://github.com/home-assistant-libs/aiowebostv, Apache License 2.0)
and PyWebOSTV (https://github.com/supersaiyanmode/PyWebOSTV, MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2017 Srivatsan Iyer). The signed manifest block of LG's test remote
app in server/internal/webos/manifest.go is taken from PyWebOSTV; it is required
by older webOS versions to read the power state. No other code is included.

